<title>USA: MidAmerican Energy sees loss from sale.</title>
<headline>MidAmerican Energy sees loss from sale.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES, Iowa 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>MidAmerican Energy Co said Thursday the sale of three oil and gas subsidiaries to KCS Energy Inc would result in an after-tax loss of $6.6 million, or $0.07 a share.</p>
<p>The company could not immediately say when it would record the loss. MidAmerican has not yet reported third-quarter results.</p>
</text>
